1940407,\"y\":0.44622093040342314},{\"text\":\"Thomas Chok were the individual cham-\",\"x\":0.12394959059703439,\"height\":0.011734601995366245,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"y\":0.4330328399507851},{\"text\":\"pions of A, B and C grades respectively.\",\"x\":0.12380408578560873,\"height\":0.01686882466096995,\"width\":0.37215803279433135,\"y\":0.41367246041258743},{\"text\":\"Xavier House, with 123 points, was the\",\"x\":0.1237166997831689,\"height\":0.017372871934408063,\"width\":0.3722636094204215,\"y\":0.39752102132135925},{\"text\":\"Champion House. We were sorry that the\",\"x\":0.12361400664857577,\"height\":0.020252171287364673,\"width\":0.37249233511991275,\"y\":0.38041407235515845},{\"text\":\"Teachers Race was cancelled this year due\",\"x\":0.1236639344214294,\"height\":0.01761320523116483,\"width\":0.37447313885356104,\"y\":0.3667470924252948},{\"text\":\"to the lack of time. Most students anxi-\",\"x\":0.12184875542491862,\"height\":0.013200257566001294,\"width\":0.3760504008448401,\"y\":0.35318737936156697},{\"text\":\"ously looked forward to this event and\",\"x\":0.1218487487027768,\"height\":0.014534883321060788,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"y\":0.33575581422609757},{\"text\":\"were a bit disappointed when it did not\",\"x\":0.11974790506077329,\"height\":0.014598526497157316,\"width\":0.3760504008448401,\"y\":0.3197037988552336},{\"text\":\"take place.\",\"x\":0.11972145349975097,\"height\":0.01183556128684271,\"width\":0.09459070959756541,\"y\":0.30658221931159113},{\"text\":\"We would like to see more boys tak-\",\"x\":0.16561729231715996,\"height\":0.018345820543002933,\"width\":0.33054182185683145,\"y\":0.27369908602384263},{\"text\":\"ing part in the Swimming\",\"x\":0.1218487497841905,\"height\":0.014567641081997373,\"width\":0.24159662291061043,\"y\":0.2601416610727191},{\"text\":\"Gala. Many\",\"x\":0.38443069053539125,\"height\":0.014701973447781236,\"width\":0.10928987724836486,\"y\":0.25718389696964106},{\"text\":\"cannot join becaus